# Photos for The Franklin Desha House live here (public/photos/).

Drop web-ready image files (jpg / webp / png) into public/photos/ and reference them
in Markdown as ![Alt text](/photos/your-file.jpg), or set a family member's `photo:`
frontmatter field to /photos/your-file.jpg to show a portrait on the /family page.

For batch cropping / resizing / optimizing of large scans, see:
  scripts/process-photos.mjs   (run `npm run photos -- --help`)

Originals you don't want served should be kept OUTSIDE public/ (e.g. a private folder
in the repo root, or a folder you gitignore) so they never get deployed.